---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About">
	<article>
		<h1>About Native Plant Revolution</h1>

		<p class="lead">
			Native Plant Revolution is a South Bay community-driven initiative dedicated to transforming degraded
			landscapes into ecologically rich native plant gardens which support birds, pollinators, and save water!
		</p>

		<section>
			<h2>Our Mission</h2>
			<p>
				We believe that every garden, no matter how small, can make a difference. Our mission
				is to restore native habitats one garden at a time, creating corridors of biodiversity
				that support pollinators, birds, and countless other species that depend on native plants
				for survival.
			</p>
			<p>
				By documenting and sharing native plant gardens in our community, we hope to inspire
				others to join the movement and discover the joy of gardening with nature, not against it.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section>
			<h2>Get Involved</h2>
			<p>
				Whether you're a seasoned native plant enthusiast or just curious about getting started,
				there are many ways to participate:
			</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Share a place you think needs its own native plant garden or tree</li>
				<li>Help with weeding and watering of our gardens</li>
				<li>Contact us if you need native plants, or need help finding some</li>
			</ul>
		</section>

		<section>
			<h2>Resources</h2>
			<p>
				Local resources for native plant gardening include:
			</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Visit gardens to gather inspiration at the Growing Natives Garden Tour</li>
				<li>Attend local native plant sales and educational events, 
					connect with other native plant gardeners in your community, with California Native Plant Society Santa Clara Valley Chapter</li>
				<li>Restore local open spaces with Grassroots Ecology</li>
				<li>Browse the resources from California Native Plant Society</li>
			</ul>
		</section>


		<section>
			<h2>Contact</h2>
			<p>
				Have questions or suggestions? We'd love to hear from you!
			</p>
			<p class="email">
				📧 <a href="mailto:hello@nativeplantrevolution.info">hello@nativeplantrevolution.info</a>
			</p>
		</section>
	</article>
</Layout>

<style>
	article {
		max-width: 700px;
	}

	.lead {
		font-size: 1.15rem;
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	section {
		margin-top: 2.5rem;
	}

	h2 {
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	ul {
		margin: 1rem 0;
		padding-left: 1.5rem;
	}

	li {
		margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
		color: var(--color-text);
	}

	li::marker {
		color: var(--color-accent);
	}

	.email {
		font-size: 1.1rem;
	}
</style>